    "Osaka: verified 10 November and 8 December 2026, second Tuesday, English rakugo plus Tsugaru shamisen. Earlier Japanese resident class is a separate programme. Historical artist photograph is not represented as this venue or current date.",
    "St Bride: verified public wood-type poster workshop on 25 November, 10:30 to 16:00. Fourteen steps, prints collected or posted later. No guaranteed same-day takeaway.",
    "Gather: actual studio is Woolwich. Specific bauble class minimum age six with adult differs from general course age rule. Booking window is not promised as individual furnace time. Collection after 48 hours. Confirm current date availability.",
    "Arvi: current official tourist cable operation closes on Tuesdays, not the frequently repeated Monday rule. Separate fare and last return matter.",
    "Santa Chiara: official opening page and FAQ differ on the closing time. Use the earlier limit and confirm. Official ticket at site, no invented advance ticket vendor.",
    "Gulbenkian: free garden access is separate from museum admission or closures. Benjakitti municipal hours are 04:30 to 22:00. Neither guide makes a medical claim.",
    "Maizajo: ordinary Condesa taqueria meal, not an unverified workshop or another branch. Tsukishima restaurant directory is not an endorsement of every member.",
    "Polybahn: opened in 1889, approximately 100 seconds, not barrier-free. Official maintenance dates noted rather than assuming uninterrupted operation."
